OPC UA service model (S88, maintainer decision E13)

The three protocol descriptions under upstream/mspec/opcua/ are unmodified Apache PLC4X
v1.0.0 files from commit ea229918f5d07700e04d7d69ab1645da679cb700. They retain their ASF
headers; upstream/manifest.toml records each path, git blob and SHA-256. Generated service
code derives from these descriptions and retains source attribution in every file.
The NodeSet revision used to produce PLC4X's generated mspec is not recorded upstream.
The protocol descriptions are repository data; the generated Rust is included in the crate.

