OPC UA test suites (S93, maintainer decision E13 part B)

The two XML files under fixtures/opcua/upstream/ are unmodified Apache PLC4X v1.0.0
files from commit ea229918f5d07700e04d7d69ab1645da679cb700 with their ASF headers retained.
The eleven raw values and twelve derived driver-message vectors there come from those
files; PROVENANCE.toml records their paths, hashes and the UNVERIFIED-capture Milo origin.
The suites, derived fixtures and test adapter are repository test data, not packaged.
